OL,3,AMore than 80 migrants feared dead after
OL,4,Aboat rescued off Canary Islands
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 80 people, including a baby,
OL,7,Fare feared to have died in a boat which
OL,8,Fwas adrift in the Atlantic Ocean for 27
OL,9,Fdays.
OL,11,FSpanish Maritime Rescue teams located
OL,12,Fthe vessel some 65 nautical miles
OL,13,Fsouthwest of Gran Canaria's coastal
OL,14,Ftown of Arguineguin on Wednesday and
OL,15,Ffound 44 survivors, with five dead
OL,16,Fbodies also on board.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
