OL,3,AMore than 80 migrants feared dead after
OL,4,Aboat rescued off Canary Islands
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boat is believed to have departed
OL,7,FThe Gambia in West Africa in early
OL,8,FAugust with 127 occupants on board.
OL,9,FHuman rights activist Helena Maleno
OL,10,FGarzon, founder of Spanish charity
OL,11,FCaminando Fronteras, said 83 people had
OL,12,Flost their lives.
OL,14,FRescuers were forced to leave the five
OL,15,Fbodies they found due to the rough sea
OL,16,Fconditions, Maritime Rescue said.
